cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HECATE in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "HECATE: Holographic Entropy Cone Analysis & Theorem Engine"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "c0mpli"
repository-code: "https://github.com/c0mpli/hecate"
url: "https://github.com/c0mpli/hecate"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-06-12
abstract: >-
  Exact graph-model toolkit for the holographic entropy cone: min-cut entropy
  engine, polyhedral cone tools with purified Sym(n+1) symmetry handling,
  contraction-map prover (brute-force and CP-SAT), canonical forms, and an
  LP cut-assignment realization search. Reproduces the 5-party cone
  (arXiv:1903.09148) and the 6-party extreme-ray classification
  (arXiv:2412.15364) in exact arithmetic.
keywords:
  - holographic entropy cone
  - quantum gravity
  - entanglement entropy
  - min-cut
  - polyhedral geometry
